{"id":"ffbff8749f50a427","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-post-problem-solved.md","title":"Post Problem Solved","display":"thm-post-problem-solved — Post Problem Solved","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-post-problem-solved","aliases":["88-thm-post-problem-solved"],"display":"thm-post-problem-solved — Post Problem Solved","depends_on":["[[88-df-post-problem]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-post-problem-solved"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-post-problem-solved</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-post-problem-solved — Post Problem Solved"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fbf21d26a14b4aa1\" href=\"?note=fbf21d26a14b4aa1\" title=\"88-df-post-problem\">88-df-post-problem</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (candidate intermediate c.e. set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)\\)</span> (Post-problem witness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fbf21d26a14b4aa1\" href=\"?note=fbf21d26a14b4aa1\" title=\"88-df-post-problem\">88-df-post-problem</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post\\text{-}problem\\text{-}solved} \\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post\\text{-}problem\\text{-}solved} \\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>展开见证谓词即<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>是 c.e.，其度严格介于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathbf0\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>之间。</li>\n<li>Friedberg 与 Muchnik 独立地通过有限损伤优先方法解决了 c.e. 版本的 Post 问题。</li>\n<li>这是递归理论的重要结果</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-post-problem","status":"resolved","id":"fbf21d26a14b4aa1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-post-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-post-problem","status":"resolved","id":"fbf21d26a14b4aa1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)$ (Post-problem witness predicate, see [[88-df-post-problem]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post\\text{-}problem\\text{-}solved} \\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0'","display":false}],"bytes":841,"backlinks":[{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-thm-ackermann-not-pr.md]]\n[[88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[88-thm-completeness.md]]\n[[88-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-friedberg-muchnik.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-problem.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict-def.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-normal-form.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-recursion.md]]\n[[88-thm-lob.md]]